OL,3,GSouth West
OL,4,
OL,5,CThis Evening and Tonight:FA dry
OL,6,Fevening with some late bright or sunny
OL,7,Fspells. Largely dry overnight with
OL,8,Fclear periods developing. Just a small
OL,9,Fchance of a light shower in areas
OL,10,Fadjacent to the Bristol Channel.
OL,11,FTurning rather cool in the countryside.
OL,12,
OL,13,CSaturday:FA dry day with a mixture of
OL,14,Fcloudy spells and sunny periods. Much
OL,15,Flighter winds than on Friday and
OL,16,Ffeeling warm in the sunshine.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
