OL,4,
OL,5,COutlook for Sunday to Tuesday:FLargely
OL,6,Ffine on Sunday with sunny spells and
OL,7,Ffeeling much warmer. Perhaps a little
OL,8,Frain overnight, then largely dry on
OL,9,FMonday. Windier on Tuesday with rain
OL,10,For showers possible.
